  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transformative Approach to Sustainable Landscapes (TASLL) in Northern Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Produce long-term, verifiable voluntary emission reductions by combining carbon sequestration with rural livelihood improvements through small-scale, farmer-led, forestry and agroforestry projects in order to reduce pressure on natural resources in national parks and forest reserves.</narrative>
  </description>
